      <h2 id="review-the-project" class="group scroll-mt-20">Review the project<a href="#review-the-project" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h2>
      <p><strong>Project</strong> &gt; <strong>Project Tools</strong> &gt; <strong>Manage Deliverables...</strong> lists eight deliverables: <code>full</code>, <code>beginner-mac</code>, <code>beginner-windows</code>, <code>podcaster-linux</code>, <code>review</code>, <code>install-variants</code>, <code>collection</code>, and <code>book-pdf</code>. The chunking examples have separate maps and are built manually.</p>
